        "disposition": "existing_identity_or_alias",
        "reasoning": "ATCC1257 identifies Menadione(VitaminK3) as the solute in its separate Menadione Solution. ChEBI28869 is menadione and the current owner already recognizes VitaminK3; the combined raw name can be added to the compound owner. The frozen ETSA50G_PER_L entry is a flattened nested50mg quantity and remains a source-dose defect, not proof of50g/L or whole-solution identity.",
        "applicability": "Exact source case Menadione (Vitamin K3). Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:009136 at ingredients/25. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. ATCC1257 identifies Menadione(VitaminK3) as the solute in its separate Menadione Solution. ChEBI28869 is menadione and the current owner already recognizes VitaminK3; the combined raw name can be added to the compound owner. The frozen ETSA50G_PER_L entry is a flattened nested50mg quantity and remains a source-dose defect, not proof of50g/L or whole-solution identity.",
